    m_Localized: 4 dice of the same value
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5318351024147
    m_Localized: Trio
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5318351024148
    m_Localized: 3 dice of the same value
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5318351024149
    m_Localized: Potion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5318351024150
    m_Localized: Berserker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5318351024151
    m_Localized: The Berserker becomes selectable on the character selection screen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5318351024152
    m_Localized: Gambler
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5318351024153
    m_Localized: The Gambler becomes selectable on the character selection screen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5318351024154
    m_Localized: D8 Die
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5318351024155
    m_Localized: The D8 becomes available on the build screen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5318351024156
    m_Localized: D10 Die
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5318351024157
    m_Localized: The D10 becomes available on the build screen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5406620151808
    m_Localized: Boss Test
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5406620151809
    m_Localized: Healer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5406620151810
    m_Localized: Card Enemy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5406620151811
    m_Localized: Ranged Enemy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5406620151812
    m_Localized: A goblin with a ranged attack; fires a crossbow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5406620151813
    m_Localized: Recruit (Tutorial)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5406620151814
    m_Localized: Thug (Tutorial)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5406620151815
    m_Localized: General Director
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5406620151816
    m_Localized: The oldest of them all. He has been alone on the top floor for so
      long that he no longer remembers for sure what the original casino rules were.
      At some point, he stopped looking for them in the manual and started making
      them up. He enforces them with complete conviction and full bureaucratic authority.
      Whether they benefit or harm the player is just an administrative detail that
      doesn't factor into his judgment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5406620151817
    m_Localized: Security Boss
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5406620151818
    m_Localized: He has spent centuries reviewing casino security protocols. Every
      action is recorded in his incident book. He detected thousands of cheaters
      in his lifetime and continues applying the same procedures even if there is
      no one left alive to protect. If the player repeats a move, he already has
      it recorded.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5406620151819
    m_Localized: The Sunken Grand
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5406620151820
    m_Localized: 'He has been calculating odds in the casino for centuries. He doesn''t
      need to guess what combo the player is going to roll: it is enough for him
      to take a part of the equation out of it. He speaks during combat making cool
      statistical observations about the player''s roll. He''s not cruel, he''s an
      actuary who never learned to shut up.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623680
    m_Localized: Attack +3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623681
    m_Localized: Roll pool +1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623682
    m_Localized: Max Health +5
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623683
    m_Localized: Speed +2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623684
    m_Localized: Greed on Ladder
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623685
    m_Localized: Each Ladder combo grants gold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623686
    m_Localized: Pair Bonus
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623687
    m_Localized: +50 damage when matching a Pair.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623688
    m_Localized: Sharpened
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623689
    m_Localized: The minimum result is always half the maximum, rounded up. A sharpened
      d6 never rolls below 3.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623690
    m_Localized: Anchor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623691
    m_Localized: If this die is held between rolls, its result increases by +1 per
      held roll (max +3).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623692
    m_Localized: Miser
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623693
    m_Localized: Grants 3 extra gold when you complete a trio combo or better.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623694
    m_Localized: Middle Faces
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623695
    m_Localized: Blocks the top and bottom quarter. d8:{3,4,5,6} d12:{4,5,6,7,8,9}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623696
    m_Localized: Loaded
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623697
    m_Localized: Once per combat you can reroll this die and keep the higher result.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623698
    m_Localized: Covetous
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623699
    m_Localized: The die joins any combo and grants +3 gold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623700
    m_Localized: Wild
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623701
    m_Localized: This die counts as any number for combo purposes (straights, trio,
      generala).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623702
    m_Localized: Climber
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623703
    m_Localized: For straights, this die counts as both its value and its value+1
      at the same time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623704
    m_Localized: Shielded
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623705
    m_Localized: If used in a full house combo it grants 2 extra shield.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623706
    m_Localized: Extremes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623707
    m_Localized: Only shows the top and bottom quarter. d8:{1,2,7,8} d12:{1,2,3,10,11,12}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623708
    m_Localized: Fortress
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623709
    m_Localized: The die shows its maximum value and joins the combo; it generates
      2 shield points.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623710
    m_Localized: Fragile
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623711
    m_Localized: 50% chance the die doesn't count toward the combo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623712
    m_Localized: Twin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623713
    m_Localized: If this die shows the same number as another in the roll, both count
      x1.5 toward the combo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623714
    m_Localized: Greed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623715
    m_Localized: If the die isn't part of a combo, it grants 2 gold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623716
    m_Localized: Odd
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623717
    m_Localized: Only shows odd faces. d6:{1,3,5} d8:{1,3,5,7} d12:{1,3,5,7,9,11}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623718
    m_Localized: Inverted
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623719
    m_Localized: The result becomes max+1 minus the result. A d6 that rolls 1 counts
      as 6.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623720
    m_Localized: Sluggish
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623721
    m_Localized: This die cannot be held between rolls.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623722
    m_Localized: Merchant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623723
    m_Localized: Grants 5 gold when you complete a straight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623724
    m_Localized: Mimic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623725
    m_Localized: Copies the result of the last rerolled die in this roll for combo
      purposes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623726
    m_Localized: Lower Half
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623727
    m_Localized: Only shows the lower half of the die. d6:{1,2,3} d8:{1,2,3,4} d12:{1,2,3,4,5,6}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623728
    m_Localized: Upper Half
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623729
    m_Localized: Only shows the upper half of the die. d6:{4,5,6} d8:{5,6,7,8} d12:{7,8,9,10,11,12}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623730
    m_Localized: Multiple of 3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623731
    m_Localized: Only shows multiples of 3. d12:{3,6,9,12}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623732
    m_Localized: Non-Prime
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623733
    m_Localized: Only shows non-prime numbers (1 included). d8:{1,4,6,8}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623734
    m_Localized: Only Evens
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623735
    m_Localized: This die only rolls even numbers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899817984
    m_Localized: Rusty
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899817985
    m_Localized: The die loses 1 from its final result (minimum 1).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899817986
    m_Localized: Even
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899817987
    m_Localized: Only shows even faces. d6:{2,4,6} d8:{2,4,6,8} d12:{2,4,6,8,10,12}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899817988
    m_Localized: Parity Gamble
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899817989
    m_Localized: If this die rolls an odd number it multiplies x3; otherwise x0.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899817990
    m_Localized: Heavy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899817991
    m_Localized: Adds +2 to the die's final result.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899817992
    m_Localized: Prime
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899817993
    m_Localized: Only shows prime numbers. d12:{2,3,5,7,11}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899817994
    m_Localized: Resonant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899817995
    m_Localized: If 2 or more dice show the same number in the final roll, this die
      adds its value to the combo twice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899817996
    m_Localized: Thirsty
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899817997
    m_Localized: Each time it joins a combo it consumes 2 gold. With no gold it can't
      take part.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899817998
    m_Localized: Clumsy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899817999
    m_Localized: Forces a full reroll on turn 2 of the combat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899818000
    m_Localized: Volatile
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899818001
    m_Localized: On a maximum roll the result doubles. On a minimum roll it's worth
      0.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531975315456
    m_Localized: Boss Room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531975315457
    m_Localized: Combat Room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531975315458
    m_Localized: Combat Room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531975315459
    m_Localized: Combat Room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531975315460
    m_Localized: Combat Room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531983704064
    m_Localized: Enchantment Room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5532067590144
    m_Localized: Potion Room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5532067590145
    m_Localized: Shop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5532067590146
    m_Localized: Starting Room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5532067590147
    m_Localized: Starting Room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5532067590148
    m_Localized: "Tutorial \u2014 Combat 1"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5532067590149
    m_Localized: "Tutorial \u2014 Combat 2"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211498464378880
    m_Localized: Warrior's Fury
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211498485350400
    m_Localized: When your health is 30 or less, your base damage increases by 5
      points. Healing above that threshold returns it to normal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800250105098240
    m_Localized: 'Master the standard die: win a run relying only on the classic
      six-sider.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800250142846976
    m_Localized: There's an exact dice recipe that opens this door. Experiment with
      the mix.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800250142846977
    m_Localized: 'Prove your eight-sided strength: carry the new die to a victory.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800250142846978
    m_Localized: A true gambler never leaves a Contract play uncashed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7867749369741312
    m_Localized: Coming soon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7867749415878656
    m_Localized: Coming soon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7868539513700352
    m_Localized: Mage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7868539555643392
    m_Localized: The Mage will become selectable in a future version.
    m_Metadata:
