    m_Localized: +50 damage when matching a Pair.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12914473343746048
    m_Localized: Poisoned
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12914473360523264
    m_Localized: You take damage at the start of each turn. Stepping on Poison again
      refreshes the duration.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12914473360523265
    m_Localized: Stunned
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12914473360523266
    m_Localized: You lose your next turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12914473360523267
    m_Localized: Spikes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12914473360523268
    m_Localized: 'Armed trap: stabs when entered or pushed onto. Rearms each round.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12914473360523269
    m_Localized: Fire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12914473360523270
    m_Localized: Burns on enter and at each turn start while standing on it. Affects
      flying units too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12914473360523271
    m_Localized: Temporary Fire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12914473364717568
    m_Localized: Fire that burns out on its own after a few rounds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12914473364717569
    m_Localized: Ice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12914473364717570
    m_Localized: You slide in the direction you entered until you leave the ice or
      hit something.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12914473364717571
    m_Localized: Portal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12914473364717572
    m_Localized: Teleports you to the linked portal and drops you on the next tile.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12914473364717573
    m_Localized: Poison
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12914473364717574
    m_Localized: 'Poisons you: damage at the start of each turn for several turns.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12914473364717575
    m_Localized: Healing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12914473364717576
    m_Localized: Heals if you <b>end</b> your turn on it. Passing through does nothing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12914473364717577
    m_Localized: Strength
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12914473364717578
    m_Localized: Your offensive combos hit harder while you stand here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12914473364717579
    m_Localized: Boost
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12914473364717580
    m_Localized: Boosts your next movement roll from this tile.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12914473364717581
    m_Localized: Telegraph
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12914473364717582
    m_Localized: Something will happen here when the round ends. Best not to be around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12914473364717583
    m_Localized: Electric Puddle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12914473364717584
    m_Localized: Stuns you for a turn when entered or pushed onto.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12914473364717585
    m_Localized: Safe Zone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12914473364717586
    m_Localized: Shields any unit inside from specific effects.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13172026588299264
    m_Localized: House Fire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13172026638630912
    m_Localized: 'The house''s flames: they last most of the hand and punish anyone
      who stands still. They burn the Croupier too.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13919417931706368
    m_Localized: The Croupier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13919417973649408
    m_Localized: Sows bombs, lights the floor and shoots from range. Crowd him and
      he bolts for the edge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13919417973649409
    m_Localized: The Cashier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13919417973649410
    m_Localized: Throws you clear and litters the floor with coins. The ones you
      don't grab in time he takes back, and each one heals him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13919417973649411
    m_Localized: Ranged Enemy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13919417973649412
    m_Localized: A goblin with a ranged attack; fires a crossbow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13919417973649413
    m_Localized: The Generala
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13919417973649414
    m_Localized: Rolls her hand in the open and charges you whatever category it
      lands. Break a die and you erase one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13919417973649415
    m_Localized: House Die
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13919417973649416
