  - m_Id: 17566757088837632
    m_Localized: Altar enchantments cost half, but cursed enchantments appear three
      times as often.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17566757822840832
    m_Localized: Tireless Runner
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17566757822840833
    m_Localized: +5 damage for every tile you moved before attacking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17566758561038336
    m_Localized: Sentinel Stone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17566758561038337
    m_Localized: +15 damage if you did not move this turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17566759316013056
    m_Localized: Pent-Up Fury
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17566759316013057
    m_Localized: Your base damage becomes 0 and grows each round you avoid damage.
      Taking damage resets it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17593279981744128
    m_Localized: Burns the room and teleports when you reach him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17593280027881472
    m_Localized: Hits harder the more gold you carry. Chips you let expire, he keeps.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17593280027881473
    m_Localized: Unleashes electric rings in waves, with gaps between the rings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17593280027881474
    m_Localized: Shoots from afar and backs away when you get close.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17593280027881475
    m_Localized: It doesn't attack. Every die broken takes a combo away from the
      Generala.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17593280027881476
    m_Localized: Bomb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17593280027881477
    m_Localized: Break it and its marked tiles go with it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17593280027881478
    m_Localized: Heals its allies before it hits you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17593280027881479
    m_Localized: Runs straight at you and swings up close.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17593280027881480
    m_Localized: Shoots from afar and backs away when you get close.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17593280027881481
    m_Localized: Poses as a chest and strikes when you get close.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17593280027881482
    m_Localized: Hits up close.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17593280027881483
    m_Localized: Hits up close.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17593280027881484
    m_Localized: The Bank Keeps
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17593280027881485
    m_Localized: Gold you let expire, the bank keeps.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17593280027881486
    m_Localized: Banned Hand
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17593280027881487
    m_Localized: You can't repeat the combo you just scored.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17593280027881488
    m_Localized: Fire Tiles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17593280027881489
    m_Localized: <b>{0}</b> on entering a tile. <b>{1}</b> if you start your turn
      on it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17593280027881490
    m_Localized: Teleport
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17593280027881491
    m_Localized: Jumps to a tile beside you, or across the room.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17593280027881492
    m_Localized: Padlock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17593280027881493
    m_Localized: One of your dice stays jammed. He draws another one every turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17593280027881494
    m_Localized: Fire Ball
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17593280027881495
    m_Localized: Lights a cone of fire.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17593280027881496
    m_Localized: Full House Burn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17593280027881497
    m_Localized: Lights the whole room except what surrounds him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17593280027881498
    m_Localized: Shot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17593280027881499
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
